t;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px"&gt;(Nhóm danh mục)&lt;/font&gt;' style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="763" y="1056" width="184" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k2e90" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="k2c15" target="k2c89"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="k2l91" value="(0,n)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;resizable=0;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1f4e79;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="k2e90"><mxGeometry x="-0.72" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="k2e92" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="k2c7" target="k2c89"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="k2l93" value="(0,1)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;resizable=0;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1f4e79;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="k2e92"><mxGeometry x="-0.72" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="k2c94" value="&lt;b&gt;tương ứng&lt;/b&gt;" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1647" y="731" width="138" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k2e95" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="k2c18" target="k2c94"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="k2l96" value="(0,1)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;resizable=0;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1f4e79;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="k2e95"><mxGeometry x="-0.72" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="k2e97" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=11;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="k2c1" target="k2c94"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="k2l98" value="(0,1)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;resizable=0;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1f4e79;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="k2e97"><mxGeometry x="-0.72" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="k2c99" value='&lt;b&gt;KN-2 Ví, danh mục, giao dịch, thông báo ngân hàng&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Một giao dịch chuyển khoản ghi nhận ở ví nguồn và tham chiếu ví nhận (mối kết hợp "nhận chuyển khoản").' style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#c9b800;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1000" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k2c100" value="&lt;b&gt;Ký hiệu&lt;/b&gt;: hình chữ nhật = thực thể · hình thoi = mối kết hợp (thuộc tính của mối kết hợp ghi trong ngoặc)&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;gạch chân&lt;/u&gt; = khóa · &lt;i&gt;/nghiêng&lt;/i&gt; = thuộc tính dẫn xuất · (min,max) = số lần thực thể tham gia mối kết hợp&lt;br&gt;nét đứt = liên kết logic, không có khóa ngoại ở mức vật lý · hộp xám viền đứt = thực thể ở trang khác" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="20" width="640" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="k3" name="KN-3 Hóa đơn và chuyển khoản QR"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="k3c1" value='&lt;b&gt;HÓA ĐƠN QUÉT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#555555"&gt;receipt_scans&lt;/font&gt;' style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=44;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="756" width="190" height="198" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k3c2" value="&lt;u&gt;Mã lần quét&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kết quả OCR&lt;br&gt;Cửa hàng&lt;br&gt;Tổng tiền&lt;br&gt;Thời điểm&lt;br&gt;Danh mục đề xuất&lt;br&gt;Độ tin cậy&lt;br&gt;Cần xem lại" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=2;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="k3c1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="44" width="190" height="154" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k3c3" value='&lt;b&gt;MÓN TRÊN HÓA ĐƠN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#555555"&gt;receipt_scan_items&lt;/font&gt;' style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=44;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="564" y="1033" width="190" height="144" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k3c4" value="&lt;u&gt;Mã món&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;Vị trí&lt;br&gt;Tên món&lt;br&gt;Số tiền&lt;br&gt;Danh mục" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=2;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="k3c3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="44" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k3c5" value='&lt;b&gt;YÊU CẦU CHUYỂN KHOẢN QR&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#555555"&gt;qr_transfer_intents&lt;/font&gt;' style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=44;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="308" y="351" width="227" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k3c6" value="&lt;u&gt;Mã yêu cầu&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;Số tài khoản nhận&lt;br&gt;Tên người nhận&lt;br&gt;Số tiền&lt;br&gt;Nội dung&lt;br&gt;Trạng thái&lt;br&gt;Thời điểm quét" style="text;html=1;align=left;ve